<title>USA: Pa. $83 mln deal restructured, yields unchanged.</title>
<headline>Pa. $83 mln deal restructured, yields unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Tuesday it restructured Pennsylvania Industrial Development Authority's $83.3 million revenue bond issue, but left yields unchanged at the repricing.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>THE PENNSYLVANIA INDUSTRIAL</p>
<p>DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $83,340,000*</p>
<p>ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>NO NEW ORDERS WILL BE TAKEN.</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>	     (A  EXP)		   (A-)		  (A  EXP)</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 09/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/1998		4,340M    4.50  %	  4.30</p>
<p>07/01/1999		5,930M    4.75  %	  4.50</p>
<p>07/01/2000		6,385M    4.60  %	100.00</p>
<p>07/01/2001		6,805M    5.25  %	  4.70</p>
<p>07/01/2002		7,010M    5.25  %	  4.80</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>07/01/2003		7,335M    5.25  %	  4.90</p>
<p>07/01/2004		7,635M    5.00  %	  5.00</p>
<p>07/01/2005		7,730M    5.50  %	  5.10</p>
<p>07/01/2006		8,205M    6.00  %	  5.20</p>
<p>07/01/2007		9,795M    6.00  %	  5.30</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>07/01/2008	     10,825M    6.00  %	  5.35</p>
<p>07/01/2009		  555M    6.00  %	  5.45</p>
<p>07/01/2010		  355M    5.50  %	  5.50</p>
<p>07/01/2011		  435M    5.50  %	  5.55</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, September 18, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on October 8, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Commonwealth Securities and Investments, Inc.</p>
<p>Pryor, McClendon, Counts &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
